<title>SOUTH KOREA: Bank of Korea sells dlrs at 864.00/865.00 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Bank of Korea sells dlrs at 864.00/865.00 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central Bank of Korea intervened in interbank market in early Friday trading, selling dollars at 864.00/865.00 won per dollar to limit the won's steep fall, dealers said.</p>
</text>
